```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant AuthService as Auth Service
    participant JwtService as JWT Service
    participant HashService as Hash Service
    participant UserService as User Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,DB: Login Flow

    User->>Frontend: Enter Email & Password
    Frontend->>API: POST /auth/login<br/>{ email, password }
    
    API->>AuthService: login(email, password)
    AuthService->>UserService: getUserByEmail(email)
    UserService->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email
    DB-->>UserService: User Record
    UserService-->>AuthService: User
    
    alt User Not Found
        AuthService-->>API: Error: Invalid Credentials
        API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
    else User Found
        AuthService->>HashService: verifyPassword(password, user.password_hash)
        HashService-->>AuthService: Password Valid/Invalid
        
        alt Password Invalid
            AuthService-->>API: Error: Invalid Credentials
            API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
        else Password Valid
            alt User Banned
                AuthService-->>API: Error: Account Banned
                API-->>Frontend: 403 Forbidden
            else User Active
                AuthService->>JwtService: generateAccessToken({ sub: user.id })
                JwtService-->>AuthService: Access Token (1 hour)
                
                AuthService->>JwtService: generateRefreshToken({ sub: user.id })
                JwtService-->>AuthService: Refresh Token (7 days)
                
                AuthService-->>API: { accessToken, refreshToken }
                API-->>Frontend: 200 OK + Tokens
                Frontend->>Frontend: Store Tokens in Cookies
                Frontend->>Frontend: Fetch User Data (/auth/me)
                Frontend-->>User: Login Successful
            end
        end
    end

    Note over User,DB: Registration Flow

    User->>Frontend: Enter Registration Data
    Frontend->>API: POST /auth/register<br/>{ email, password, ... }
    
    API->>AuthService: register(data)
    AuthService->>UserService: getUserByEmail(email)
    UserService->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email
    DB-->>UserService: User or null
    
    alt User Already Exists
        AuthService-->>API: Error: Email Already Exists
        API-->>Frontend: 409 Conflict
    else New User
        AuthService->>HashService: hashPassword(password)
        HashService-->>AuthService: Password Hash
        
        AuthService->>UserService: createUser({ email, password_hash, ... })
        UserService->>DB: INSERT user
        DB-->>UserService: Created User
        
        AuthService->>JwtService: generateAccessToken({ sub: user.id })
        AuthService->>JwtService: generateRefreshToken({ sub: user.id })
        AuthService-->>API: { accessToken, refreshToken }
        API-->>Frontend: 201 Created + Tokens
        Frontend-->>User: Registration Successful
    end
```